ndeep/job-worker-svc/issues/4","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/4/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/4/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/4/events","html_url":"https://github.com/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/pull/4","id":4291374535,"node_id":"PR_kwDOR-Vyls7TvHqs","number":4,"title":"Add cli client and add e2e test script to test setup","user":{"login":"rajansandeep","id":30265084,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMjY1MDg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30265084?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep","html_url":"https://github.com/rajansandeep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-19T16:21:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T15:28:36Z","closed_at":"2026-04-22T15:28:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/pulls/4","html_url":"https://github.com/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/pull/4","diff_url":"https://github.com/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/pull/4.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/pull/4.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-22T15:28:36Z"},"body":"Adds a CLI client for users to interact with the service.\r\nAlso adding an e2e test to test various scenarios and see how it functions in scenarios.\r\n\r\n### Manual run of server and CLI\r\n\r\n```\r\n% make certs build-server\r\n./scripts/generate-certs.sh certs\r\nGenerating CA...\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=JobWorker CA\r\nGenerating server certificate...\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=localhost\r\nGenerating client certificate for admin...\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=admin\r\nGenerating client certificate for viewer...\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=viewer\r\nCertificates written to certs/\r\nadmin.crt\r\nadmin.key\r\nca.crt\r\nca.key\r\nca.srl\r\nserver.crt\r\nserver.key\r\nviewer.crt\r\nviewer.key\r\ngo build -o ./jobworker-server ./cmd/jobworker-server\r\n\r\n./jobworker-server \\\r\n  --cert certs/server.crt \\\r\n  --key  certs/server.key \\\r\n  --ca   certs/ca.crt\r\n2026/04/19 09:09:10 jobworker-server listening on :50051\r\n\r\n\r\n% export JOBWORKER_CERT=certs/admin.crt\r\n% export JOBWORKER_KEY=certs/admin.key\r\n% export JOBWORKER_CA=certs/ca.crt\r\n% JOB_ID=$(./jobworker-cli start -- sh -c 'for i in $(seq 1 5); do echo \"line $i\"; sleep 1; done')\r\n% ./jobworker-cli stream \"$JOB_ID\"\r\nline 1\r\nline 2\r\nline 3\r\nline 4\r\nline 5\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Test\r\n\r\ne2e test added:\r\n\r\n```\r\n./scripts/e2e-all.sh \r\n\r\n==> Checking prerequisites\r\n\r\n==> Running race detector\r\n?       github.com/rajansandeep/teleport-job-worker-svc/cmd/jobworker-cli       [no test files]\r\n?       github.com/rajansandeep/teleport-job-worker-svc/cmd/jobworker-server    [no test files]\r\n?       github.com/rajansandeep/teleport-job-worker-svc/gen/jobworker/v1        [no test files]\r\nok      github.com/rajansandeep/teleport-job-worker-svc/internal/grpcserver     (cached)\r\nok      github.com/rajansandeep/teleport-job-worker-svc/internal/worker (cached)\r\nPASS: go test -race ./... passed\r\n\r\n==> Building binaries\r\nPASS: binaries built\r\n\r\n==> Generating local certs\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=JobWorker CA\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=localhost\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=admin\r\nCertificate request self-signature ok\r\nsubject=CN=viewer\r\nPASS: certs generated\r\n\r\n==> Starting server\r\nPASS: server started\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 1: successful job completes and streams output\r\nPASS: successful job scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 2: failed job reports Failed and non-zero exit\r\nPASS: failed job scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 3: stop a long-running job\r\nPASS: stop scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 4: viewer authz\r\nPASS: authorization scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 5: multiple concurrent streams with different join times\r\nPASS: multi-stream late joiner scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 6: one reader exits early, another still gets full output\r\nPASS: early reader exit scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 7: concurrent Stop requests\r\nPASS: concurrent stop scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 8: concurrent status polling while job runs\r\nPASS: concurrent status polling scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 9: invalid job id behavior\r\nPASS: not-found scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 10: stream a job that completed before stream is called\r\nPASS: stream completed job scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 11: job with no output exits cleanly\r\nPASS: no-output job scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 12: start with a non-existent binary\r\nPASS: non-existent binary scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 13: start with an empty command is rejected\r\nPASS: invalid command scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 14: stop a completed job returns not-running\r\nPASS: stop completed job scenario\r\n\r\n==> Scenario 15: viewer status on a non-existent job returns not-found\r\nPASS: viewer not-found scenario\r\n\r\n==> All scenarios passed\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"rajansandeep","id":30265084,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMjY1MDg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30265084?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep","html_url":"https://github.com/rajansandeep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajansandeep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/rajansandeep/job-worker-svc/pull/3","id":4289733533,"node_id":"PR_kwDOR-Vyls7TqWkW","